DFToolBox
~~~~~~~~~

- relicensed from GPL-2.0-or-later to GPL-3.0-or-later
- Windows builds are back, as a 64-bit zip from `nix build`
- sounds are played with Qt Multimedia, SDL is no longer needed
- dftool-insert looks for dreamfall-mods/ in the user data directory
  first, see the README
- Windows: configuration moved to %APPDATA%\dftoolbox\config\, the old
  location is still read
- new options --version, --portable, --no-save, --show-paths and
  --user-data-dir, --datadir, --configdir and --cachedir became
  --data-dir, --config-dir and --cache-dir
- a startup report goes to stderr
- bookmark loading/saving
- fixed mp3 and wav playback, now using Windows functions instead of
  SDL

